{"name": "Magin: The Rat Project Stories", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.poster.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.webm?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8b981a3f7d40e698d2d73c45b4f4fe33.mp4?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><i>Magin: The Rat Project Stories</i> takes place in a dark fantasy world, where magic \u2013 or essence, as it is called \u2013 is directly tied to the desires and fears of its inhabitants.<br/> <br/>Shape the fate of Elester, a Magin and veteran hitman in an underworld syndicate, as well as young Tolen, who is about to realize that he too can use the essence to his advantage.<br/><br/>Step into a mature, magical world standing on the edge of an industrial revolution and utter chaos. <br/><br/>Overcome obstacles, play your cards wisely, and find your destiny in this immersive, story-driven adventure.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/572be0b0069db5dff40dcc8f588958fd.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore atmospheric and mysterious locations by investigating the environment, and interacting with items.<br/></li><li>Battle horrific creatures and meet numerous complex characters - potential allies or foes.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.poster.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.webm?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/8082381b22fa181bf72efa97dc7c116b.mp4?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/6923c7a06ce0552db578810abdf8ee11.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage your essence by utilizing emotions, both in combat and during exploration.<br/></li><li>The emotional state of your character influences the story and various gameplay mechanics.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.poster.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.webm?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/0d4ea85d6542e8114b966e3b8253dd15.mp4?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/abe0b60461369a0b207a63b58231c4b2.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse yourself in a cold and harsh fantasy world where medieval culture is confronted with the invention of industrial, magic-powered machines, and the forces that seek to control them.<br/></li><li>Follow the main characters on their journey of lost and redeemed hope and decide its outcome based on your choices.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.poster.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.webm?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/770747c2acac1e82cb1b67488ef07761.mp4?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/d322a97c876e01195f6f6703b41395d4.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"/></span><br/><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Manage and upgrade your deck as the story progresses.<br/></li><li>Gain special cards from story choices and defeated enemies.<br/></li><li>Craft unique double-sided, emotion-infused essence cards fitting your strategy.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.poster.avif?t=1780309981\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.webm?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/extras/5afe8d3b6f6792c47deb0c90ebdfc644.mp4?t=1780309981\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </div>", "short_desc": "Magin is an exciting combination of a narrative-driven adventure game with a deck-building card battler. The branching plot, comic book aesthetic, full voice-over, and game mechanics are tightly intertwined in a unique, dark fantasy world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1205270/3daa651b907071d93337b1e685b93c7a301b5c8b/header.jpg?t=1780309981", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Indie", "Card Game", "Story Rich", "2D", "Deckbuilding"], "developers": "The Rat Project", "publishers": "The Rat Project", "release_date": "Apr 29, 2026", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "1205270", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tnZevhzRAL0", "first_seen": 1777413600.0, "review_rank": 770}